lso concerning but we have evidence of reliability and stress resilience, which are more critical. So we keep B as provisional recommendation, but call for more info on numerical accuracy and crew cooperation.\n\nThus vote remains Candidate B.\n\nWe must produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON.\n\nPublic message: say I still recommend B, explain why, referencing Agent 2's concerns, and argue D's concerns are also significant. Also note need to discuss A and C later.\n\nLet's craft."}
